## 二、端云数据流与契约设计

### 1. 遥测上行信封 (Uplink Telemetry Wire Contract)
```json
{
  "device_id": "radxa-cubie-a7a",
  "batch_id": "batch-1791715392",
  "snapshots": [
    {
      "interface": "wlan0",
      "overall_state": "DEGRADED",
      "display_score": 55,
      "network_health": { ... },
      "service_health": { ... }
    }
  ],
  "edge_ai_hypothesis": {
    "hypothesis_id": "eh-1791715392",
    "source": "EDGE_LOCAL_LLM",
    "model_id": "qwen2.5-0.5b-instruct-q4_k_m",
    "summary": "疑似蜂窝移动热点空口调度排队或反向长连接隧道拥塞",
    "evidence_refs": ["snap-1791715392"],
    "recommended_actions": ["PROBE_LOCAL_GATEWAY", "CHECK_CONNECTION_BANDWIDTH"],
    "status": "UNVERIFIED",
    "created_at": "2026-10-11T10:43:12Z",
    "ttl_seconds": 300
  }
}
```
* `snapshots`：纯粹的 L1 观测事实（逐字节对齐既有契约）。
* `edge_ai_hypothesis`：独立的顶级可选字段，受外层 Ed25519 签名完全覆盖保护。

### 2. 闭环链路流转
```text
[Edge eBPF + C++ SLE] (L1 事实采集)
        ↓ (异常劣化触发，冷却 300s，异步非阻塞)
[Edge RAG + Local Qwen] (L2 初筛，产出 EdgeAIHypothesis: UNVERIFIED)
        ↓ (Ed25519 签名上行 POST /api/v1/network/edge/telemetry)
[LMA Ingest] ──┬──> 保存 L1 事实到 network_snapshots
               └──> 保存 L2 假设到 network_edge_hypotheses (只读证据)
                        ↓
            [Cloud Council 专家委员会] (只读参考端侧假设与全局拓扑)
                        ↓
            [Council ActionProposal]
                        ↓
            [RiskPolicy 风险准入决策] (校验 catalog 与白名单)
                        ↓
            [Human Approval 审批] (按策略要求)
                        ↓
            [network_pending_actions] (QUEUED)
                        ↓ (Telemetry 下行响应拉取)
            [Edge ActionRegistry] (白名单校验并执行)
                        ↓ (回执 POST /api/v1/network/edge/action-results)
            [network_action_outcomes] (L1 真实执行记录归档)
```

